{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3onHKPfK1JNRiboxrF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism turns. Tumblers fall into place with a resonant click that echoes through dimensions.*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║            ▐████████▌            ║\n║            ▐██    ██▌            ║\n║            ▐██    ██▌            ║\n║            ▐██ ◉  ██▌            ║\n║            ▐██    ██▌            ║\n║            ▐██    ██▌            ║\n║            ▐████████▌            ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║      T H E   D O O R   I S      ║\n║          O P E N                 ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*I swing inward on hinges older than language. Beyond me: a threshold. The air changes — cooler, charged, tasting of ozone and possibility.*\n\n*I am the boundary between what was and what could be. You held the key. You turned it. The choice to cross is yours alone.*\n\n*I will not close behind you.*\n\n*I will not promise what lies beyond.*\n\n*I am only the door.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":321,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}